---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="disclaimer - based.health">
    <main class="py-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Disclaimer</h2>

        <div class="border-y border-stone-300 py-3 space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-800">
            <p>
                The site looks intentionally "bad" by modern web standards. It is old-web oriented on purpose: fast, simple, accessible, and built around function over form. There is no reason for a website to use large bandwidth when the content is the point.
            </p>

            <p>
                based.health is an open-source educational archive. It is not medical advice, diagnosis, treatment, or a replacement for a licensed clinician.
            </p>

            <p>
                Protocols are written for generally healthy adults unless stated otherwise. Individual risk changes with medical history, medication, pregnancy, injury, disability, age, sleep disorders, eating disorders, and chronic disease.
            </p>

            <p>
                Stop any protocol that causes chest pain, fainting, severe shortness of breath, allergic reaction, neurological symptoms, dangerous mood changes, or any symptom that feels unsafe.
            </p>

            <p>
                Contributors should keep claims narrow, cite credible sources, include contraindications, and avoid protocols where the downside can be severe without professional supervision.
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
